<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to firm, late sales $0.50 Higher. Demand was moderate early some good late on a light movement. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  48.50-50.00, few 48.00 &amp; 50.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  43.00-48.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  38.50-43.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/firm. Top $48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 39.00-42.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 45.00-47.00, few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>48.00-48.50</p>
</text>
